            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This app can send anonymous usage data that helps troubleshoot issues and understand usage. Data is never linked to your Apple Account. Never included: checklist item names, item notes, or any Apple or iCloud identifiers. You can change this anytime in Settings."
